# This repo publishes code, patches and documentation only. Everything else
# (captures, photos, logs, build output, generated data, private notes) stays
# out on purpose: the repo is public, and a capture or a photo can carry
# something personal without anyone noticing at upload time.
#
# Deny everything, then allow by extension. A new file type has to be added
# here deliberately before it can be committed.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!LICENSE
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.c
!*.h
!*.ps1
!*.patch
!*.diff
!*.service
!*.rules
!*.conf
!*.toml
!*.json
!*.jsonl
!*.csv
!*.html
!*.example

# Narrow binary exceptions, each one referenced by a doc.
!docs/a520m-rear-usb3-port-pairs.png
!forum-attachments/*.bin

# Never, even when the extension is allowed above.
local-notes/
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
NEXT-STEP.md
power-on-stats.jsonl
scripts/.private-patterns
__pycache__/
nv-debug-*/
nv-report-*/
windows-kit2/
experiments/webcam/
# Calibration captures: the numbers live in docs/ and docs/pruebas.jsonl.
docs/led-photometry/
